  "title": "Baked Pork Chops and Rice",
  "description": "Tender baked pork chops with rice is an easy one-dish meal that gets plenty of flavor thanks to caramelized onions mixed into the rice.",
  "authors": [
    "rev'd up chef"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:58:25-04:00",
